[{"category":"section","location":"#CensoBR","page":"Home","text":"Documentation for CensoBR.\n\n","title":"CensoBR"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._census_url-Tuple{Integer, Union{String, Symbol}}","page":"Home","text":"_census_url(year, uf)\n\nReturn the official IBGE URL for a Census microdata archive.\n\nExamples\n\n_census_url(2000, \"RJ\")\n_census_url(2010, :RJ)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._census_url"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._default_cache_dir-Tuple{}","page":"Home","text":"defaultcache_dir()\n\nDefault location for downloaded CensoBR files.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._default_cache_dir"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._download_census-Tuple{Integer, Any}","page":"Home","text":"downloadcensus(year, uf; cachedir=defaultcachedir(), force=false, show_progress=true)\n\nDownload an official IBGE Census microdata archive.\n\nReturns the path to the cached ZIP file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._download_census"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._download_documentation-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","text":"_download_documentation(year; cache_dir=_default_cache_dir(),\n                        force=false, show_progress=true)\n\nDownload the official IBGE documentation archive for a Census year.\n\nReturns the path to the cached ZIP file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._download_documentation"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._download_file-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","text":"_download_file(url, destination; force=false, show_progress=true, description=\"Downloading\")\n\nDownload a file to destination, optionally displaying a progress bar.\n\nDownloads are first written to a temporary .part file and moved to the final destination only after a successful transfer. If destination already exists and force=false, the existing file is returned.\n\nReturns the path to the downloaded file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._download_file"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._extract_census-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","text":"extractcensus(zippath; destination=nothing, force=false)\n\nExtract a Census ZIP archive with 7-Zip.\n\nReturns the extraction directory.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._extract_census"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._find_layout-Tuple{CensoBR.SASLayout, Symbol, AbstractString}","page":"Home","text":"_find_layout(source::LayoutSource, record::Symbol, extracted_dir::AbstractString)\n\nFind the official IBGE layout file for record in extracted_dir.\n\nThe method dispatches on _layout_source to account for differences in how Census layout files are distributed. For example, the 2000 Census uses SAS layout files, while the 2010 Census uses an Excel workbook.\n\nReturns the path to the layout file.\n\nThrows an error if the appropriate layout file cannot be found.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._find_layout"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._layout_source-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","text":"Determine the layout source based on the Census year \n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._layout_source"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._load_layout-Tuple{Integer, Symbol, AbstractString}","page":"Home","text":"_load_layout(year::Integer, record::Symbol, extracted_dir::AbstractString)\n\nLoad the official IBGE layout for a Census record.\n\nDetermines the layout source associated with year, locates the corresponding layout file in extracted_dir, and parses the layout for record.\n\nReturns the parsed layout in CensoBR's common internal representation.\n\nThrows an error if year is unsupported, the layout file cannot be found, or the layout cannot be parsed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._load_layout"},{"category":"method","location":"#CensoBR._prepare_census-Tuple{Integer, Any}","page":"Home","text":"preparecensus(year, uf; cachedir=defaultcachedir(), force=false)\n\nDownload and extract an IBGE Census archive.\n\nReturns the directory containing the extracted raw files.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CensoBR._prepare_census"}]
